shploingus.theme/1
# The LittleBigPlanet Popit scheme: the suite's cream cardboard, its green confirm and its
# orange alert, on the rounded LBP3 slab. `renderer popit` asks the shell for the port's
# surface renderer; `form popit` is the geometry axis. Either can be swapped without
# touching the other, and the generic renderer remains the fallback when the port is absent.
theme	popit
	label	Popit
	source	LittleBigPlanet Popit suite (LBP3 window form)
	body	#E8D9B8F2
	panel	#F4E7C8F2
	title	#D8C49AF2
	meta	#DCCDAEF2
	border	#4A3F38
	borderStrong	#231F1B
	ink	#231F1B
	muted	#5A4E40
	accent	#3F7D24
	alert	#D95B2B
	alertBody	#F0D2C4F2
# The Popit palette reaches the game surfaces the shell frames. The HUD bar becomes the
# cream card edge; the shop keeps the same card with the green accent border.
rule	.CitadelHudTopBar	background-color	role:body
rule	.CitadelHudTopBar	border-color	role:borderStrong
rule	.CitadelHudHeroShop	background-color	role:body
rule	.CitadelHudHeroShop	border-color	role:accent
